<title>USA: NUI files to offer 1.15 mln shares.</title>
<headline>NUI files to offer 1.15 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>BEDMINSTER, N.J. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>NUI Corp said Friday it has filed to sell up to 1.15 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to use the proceeds to retire short-term debt used to finance the acquisition of a 49 percent limited liability company interest in TIC Enterprises Inc and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>NUI said it intends to commence the proposed offering next month.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
